# DEPRECATED: Git submodules are no longer used in PyTTI Modern
#
# PyTTI Modern uses modern AI models from PyPI packages:
# - Depth: Depth-Anything-V2, Marigold (via transformers/diffusers)
# - Flow: CoTracker, RAFT (via pip packages)
# - CLIP: Modern CLIP, SigLIP (via transformers)
